# CLI streaming (OpenCode / Cursor)

```elixir
Mix.install([{:elixir_harness, path: "."}])
```

Each CLI run is an Erlang `Port`: line streaming, budget kill, no blocking.

```elixir
ElixirHarness.CLI.OpenCode.run("summarize this repo",
  exe: "/bin/echo",
  args: [],
  on_line: &IO.puts("line> #{&1}")
)
```

Swap `exe: "/bin/echo"` for the real `opencode` / `cursor` binary.
`max_ms` / `max_bytes` kill hung runs — the harness never wedges.
